[Opponent "3...Bg4"]
[Start "1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 d6 3. d4 Bg4 4. dxe5 Bxf3 5. Qxf3 dxe5 6. Bc4"]

6... Nf6 $2 { Develops and attacks e4, but forgets that f7 is already under fire from the bishop and queen. } 7. Qb3 { Attacks f7 and b7 together. Black cannot defend both, so a pawn drops, and the black king is stuck in the centre. } 7... Qe7 8. Nc3 { Brings a new piece in while Black is tied down. } 8... c6 9. Bg5 *
